060306   % CALL RTOFF(PROG)
060306   SUBR RTON,RTOFF
060306   RTON:  CALL GET1; CALL RTCHECK; X.ACTPRI BZERO 5RTOFF; GO RTO
060313   RTOFF: CALL GET1; CALL RTCHECK; X.ACTPRI BONE 5RTOFF
060317   RTO:   A=:X.ACTPRI; GO RET
